    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFor Sale by DNG Online Auction TO REGISTER FOR OUR ONLINE AUCTION on the 30th September 2026 at 2pm.Visit www.dngauctions.ieChoose/ Search for your property of interest, click log in & register to bid and follow the necessary steps.Bidder security required prior to auction date in order to successfully bid on the day.\n\nDNG Martin O'Connor Estate Agents are delighted to present for sale by DNG Online Auction on 30th September 2026 at 2pm this unique parcel of coastal land extending to approximately 0.19 hectares (0.47 acres), occupying an exceptional waterfront position in the heart of Furbo, Co. Galway.\n\nOverlooking the crystal-clear waters of Galway Bay towards the Burren, this distinctive holding enjoys an outstanding setting along one of Ireland's most scenic coastal routes. The property includes an attractive traditional stone-walled enclosure to the front, creating a wonderful vantage point from which to enjoy the uninterrupted sea views, spectacular sunsets and ever-changing coastal landscape.\n\nPositioned opposite Furbo Beach, the property enjoys an enviable location with public parking immediately adjacent, while the renowned Pádraicíns Gastropub and the excellent amenities of Furbo Village are all within easy reach. A footpath along the R336 provides convenient pedestrian access to the village centre, approximately 1 km away.\n\nPlease note this property will be offered by online auction (unless sold prior). Vendors may decide to accept pre-auction bids so please register your interest with us to avoid disappointment. The successful bidder is required to pay the balance of 10% deposit and contracts are signed immediately on acceptance of a bid.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a unique piece of Galway's coastline in one of the county's most desirable seaside locations. Whether as an investment, a coastal retreat or an addition to an adjoining holding, opportunities to purchase land in such a spectacular setting seldom arise."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> c. 0.19 hectares (0.47 acres)</li><li> Exceptional waterfront location overlooking Galway Bay</li><li> Traditional stone-walled coastal enclosure</li><li> Opposite Furbo Beach</li><li> Public parking immediately adjacent</li><li> Spectacular sea views towards the Burren</li><li> Approx. 1 km from Furbo Village via the coastal footpath</li><li> Situated along the renowned R336 Coast Road</li><li> Rare opportunity in one of Galway's most sought-after coastal locations</li><li> For Sale by DNG Online Auction</ul>"
      },
